    foot.innerHTML=`<h3>${b(['本知識點參考文獻與閱讀範圍','References and Reading Scope for This Topic'])}</h3><p>${b(['方括號編號沿用原論文參考文獻；[Main]代表Arad原文。延伸說明與新互動為本網站的教學整理，不是原文圖表或程式重現。','Bracketed numbers match the main paper’s bibliography; [Main] is Arad. Extensions and new interactions are teaching designs, not reproduced figures or source code.'])}</p>${sourceCards(info.refs,{b,e})}<a href="#literature-review">${b(['查看本次修改清單與文獻閱讀紀錄 →','Review All Changes and the Reading Log →'])}</a>`;
