      if(info.kind==='calibration'){const m=calibration(state.exposure),i=state.band;out.innerHTML=`<p>${b([`正在照射 ${[450,550,650][i]} nm 單色光，物體光譜在此步驟不是未知數。`,`Illuminating with ${[450,550,650][i]} nm light; its level is known in this calibration step.`])}</p><div class="lit-metrics">${metric(['已知入射光L','Known Light L'],m.light[i].toFixed(2))}${metric(['曝光t','Exposure t'],state.exposure.toFixed(1))}${metric(['記錄訊號q','Recorded Signal q'],m.counts[i].toFixed(3))}${metric(['估得敏感度s','Estimated Sensitivity s'],(m.counts[i]/(m.light[i]*state.exposure)).toFixed(3))}</div><p class="lit-formula">q ÷ (L × t) = ${m.counts[i].toFixed(3)} ÷ (${m.light[i].toFixed(2)} × ${state.exposure.toFixed(1)}) = ${m.sensitivity[i].toFixed(3)}</p><p>${b(['加長曝光時q會變，但除以已知光強與曝光後，s保持不變。假設感測器線性、未飽和，且已扣除暗訊號。這不是用物體未知RGB直接猜敏感度。','Longer exposure changes q, but dividing by known light and exposure leaves s unchanged. Assumes linear, unsaturated sensing with dark signal removed. This is not sensitivity estimation from an unknown object’s RGB alone.'])}</p>`;}
