      if(info.kind==='pca'){const n=pcaCounts[state.dataset][state.threshold===90?0:1];out.innerHTML=`<div class="lit-metrics">${metric(['資料集','Dataset'],state.dataset)}${metric(['保留變異門檻','Retained-Variance Threshold'],state.threshold+'%')}${metric(['有效成分數','Effective Component Count'],String(n))}</div><div class="lit-count-track" aria-hidden="true">${Array.from({length:23},(_,i)=>`<i class="${i<n?'is-filled':''}"></i>`).join('')}</div><p>${b(['每格代表一個成分；不是波段或原子。NATURAL是該文的一套自然物體反射率資料，不是所有自然光譜的通用維度。','Each block represents a component, not a band or atom. NATURAL is one reflectance collection in that paper, not a universal dimension of natural spectra.'])}</p><p>${b(['資料名稱：MUNSELL色票、NATURAL自然物體、OBJECT物體集合、PIGMENT油畫顏料、SUBLIM熱昇華色樣。表2。','Datasets: MUNSELL chips, NATURAL natural objects, OBJECT collection, PIGMENT oil-paint pigments, SUBLIM dye-sublimation samples. Table 2.'])}</p>`;}
